873
01:28:20,502 --> 01:28:22,595
Joelhos fracos...

874
01:28:29,387 --> 01:28:31,137
A natureza chamando.

875
01:28:41,044 --> 01:28:42,794
Tio.

876
01:28:45,081 --> 01:28:47,960
Tio,
Adi está em perigo.

877
01:28:48,154 --> 01:28:51,019
Precisamos salvar
Adi agora, tio.

878
01:28:57,419 --> 01:28:58,824
Adi.

879
01:28:59,585 --> 01:29:01,335
Vamos orar.

880
01:29:09,460 --> 01:29:11,210
Como...

881
01:29:11,794 --> 01:29:13,544
